# Guitar Freaks 6th Mix (G*B06 VER. JAA), Konami 2001: the first boot's install, from blank NVRAM (the game cassette
# in). NOTE 604 asks for Test to update the CD-ROM drive's firmware (by frame 600): Test at
# 1200, and the version-up passes at once. Then the CD installs itself to the onboard flash, then the 32 MiB PC Card in slot 1.
# By frame ~23100 it shows INFO 508: install done, note the certificate number and power-cycle.
# Hashes the main RAM every frame and snapshots every 60 frames, to compare HIRAKU's 573 core
# with MAME through the install.
game gtrfrk6m

hash ram  0x80000000 0x80400000   # 4 MiB main RAM (KSEG0)

at 1200 press "Service Mode" 8   # NOTE 604: start the CD-ROM drive's version-up
from 0 every 60 snap
at 24000 quit
